>

I consider the following messages as "rant".

then it appears there really isn't much need for me to read any more emails=
=20
> from you. I would be willing to consider otherwise, if you can demonstrat=
e=20
> useful work you have contributed. The "lojban berries" is almost the most=
=20
> useless thing I can think of -- *of course* "ckule" looks and sounds like=
